@startuml
abstract class DiscountHandler {
  # DiscountHandler next
  + void setNext(DiscountHandler next)
  + abstract void handle(Order order)
}
class PromoCodeHandler extends DiscountHandler
class StudentHandler extends DiscountHandler
class PensionerHandler extends DiscountHandler
class Order {
  + double price
  + boolean isDiscountApplied
}

DiscountHandler o--> DiscountHandler : next
PromoCodeHandler --> Order : modifies
StudentHandler --> Order : modifies
PensionerHandler --> Order : modifies
note right of DiscountHandler : Handler
note right of Order : Context
@enduml
